I'm always a bit wary of using wands of cancellation around bags of
holding....

Try looting the bag on the ground.  A bag of holding's weight is
always some multiple of its contents plus a small amount for the bag
itself.  Uncursed: X .5.  Blessed: X 1.4.  Cursed, X 2.  So if you can
get stuff out of the bag, it'll become lighter, eventually light
enough to carry.

However there is a problem with this: looking into a cursed bag of
holding randomly destroys some of the items inside of it.  That will
also make the bag lighter, but at the cost of some of your stuff.

